District AI for Linux: third-party licences

The district-ai binary statically links the Rust crates below. Each keeps its
own licence; this file holds the text of every licence they are under, with the
crates each text covers. It is written by cargo-about from Cargo.lock when the
package is built (about.toml and about.hbs in the source repository).

libwebrtc, which a build with calls also links, has its own licence file,
libwebrtc-LICENSE.md, beside this one. The project's own licence is in the
copyright file and NOTICE.

